{"id":"n63930-1-7","stage":3,"title":"손끝 · 手指尖","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63930-1-7-1","ko":"이 연고는 어떻게 바르나요?","zh":"这种药膏要怎么涂呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"연고는","meaning":"软膏，药膏","explanation":"연고：软膏，药膏；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"연고","audio":"/audio/b75ff9a6f8753e6e72f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23550","senseId":"1","lemma":"연고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"연고는","audio":"/audio/7e3a9f6ee3fdcb10f7f9.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"바르나요?","meaning":"抹，搽","explanation":"바르다：抹，搽；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"바르다","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62652","senseId":"1","lemma":"바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바르나요","audio":"/audio/4a1973c61d94a7322ce3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"b75ff9a6f8753e6e","term":"연고","zh":"软膏，药膏","audio":"/audio/b75ff9a6f8753e6e72f9.mp3","entryId":"23550","definition":"涂在皮肤上治疗病或伤口的药。","pronunciation":["연ː고"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"3b42ecf8717cc7fd","term":"바르다","zh":"抹，搽","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3","entryId":"62652","definition":"把液体或粉末等置于物体表面揉擦，使其被均匀涂抹。","pronunciation":["바르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/af30d56faa02c4b1d742.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63930-1-7-2","ko":"손끝에 살짝 묻혀서 입술에 발라 주세요.","zh":"请在指尖上稍微沾一点，然后涂在嘴唇上。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손끝에","meaning":"手指尖","explanation":"손끝：手指尖；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"손끝","audio":"/audio/73918ab067122ae9639b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63930","senseId":"1","lemma":"손끝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손끝에","audio":"/audio/64c008c547d417d7d3b3.mp3"}},{"text":"살짝","meaning":"稍微","explanation":"살짝：稍微。","readings":[{"term":"살짝","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61612","senseId":"3","lemma":"살짝","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살짝","audio":"/audio/cf17ce5604310bf9c196.mp3"}},{"text":"묻혀서","meaning":"沾上，染上","explanation":"묻히다：沾上，染上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"묻히다","audio":"/audio/28120c6c18d8503b1de4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15725","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻혀서","audio":"/audio/921ffd9e4d7137a18e91.mp3"}},{"text":"입술에","meaning":"嘴唇","explanation":"입술：嘴唇；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"입술","audio":"/audio/94eae6bfefacd134dec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75753","senseId":"1","lemma":"입술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입술에","audio":"/audio/9a696c4ced290676126f.mp3"}},{"text":"발라","meaning":"抹，搽","explanation":"바르다：抹，搽；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"바르다","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62652","senseId":"1","lemma":"바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"발라","audio":"/audio/443f850026db05d11b16.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanati